#: src/Admin/Settings.php:189
msgid "Code prefix"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:190
msgid "A short tag added to the front of every code so customers and support can recognise it at a glance. Example: \"GIFT-\" produces GIFT-AB12CD34. Leave blank for codes with no prefix."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:203
msgid "Optional. Prepended to every generated code, e.g. \"GIFT-\". Up to 12 characters."
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:209
msgid "Checkout discount label"
msgstr ""

#: src/Admin/Settings.php:210
msgid "The text shown on the discount line at checkout when a code is applied (e.g. \"Gift card (GIFT-AB12CD34)\"). Use the {code} token to include the applied code."
